{"id":"wb-6-739","name":"惠光寺塔和常乐寺塔","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T13:25:15+00:00","status":"ready","title":"东西寺塔","text":"东西寺塔是位于云南省昆明市的两座古代佛塔，原分别坐落于常乐寺和惠光寺内，故又名常乐寺塔和惠光寺塔。1983年1月，两塔被云南省人民政府公布为第二批省级重点文物保护单位，2006年，国务院将二者列入第六批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E4%B8%9C%E8%A5%BF%E5%AF%BA%E5%A1%94","revisionId":93806987,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=93806987","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"复核百科重定向、文物名称与同一地点；引用版本已锁定","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/cbf9fd92aefac55ccd3cba6d.jpg","title":"Kunming_Western_Pagoda_2023-01.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kunming_Western_Pagoda_2023-01.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/8/85/Kunming_Western_Pagoda_2023-01.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"XuasdYX","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​2023年2月9日的昆明西寺塔。","width":320,"height":480,"matchEvidence":"已复核文物对应百科条目的主图","subject":"东西寺塔"}}